Genome Firewall

This prototype reuses the public Genome Firewall / Biohackers implementation:

  https://github.com/omarjku/Biohackers
  (canonical clone URL: https://github.com/Omar-s-Org/Biohackers.git)

The upstream README claims the MIT License. The GitHub repository metadata
did not attach an SPDX license file at the time of reuse; a MIT LICENSE is
included here to match that claim. Preserve attribution to the original
authors and to:

  AMRFinderPlus (NCBI, public domain) — https://github.com/ncbi/amr
  BV-BRC genomes and laboratory AST labels — https://www.bv-brc.org/
  scikit-learn

This application is a research prototype, not a clinical diagnostic.
